# Homeostat mechanism universe — minimal proof (2026-08-31), per docs/ETIOLOGY_ENGINE.md §8.
# Recognizes mechanistic ROLES over gene relational-signal facts (subject-verb-object), by the ROLE
# VERB, never the gene token. Trigger column = the rules' OWN antecedent verbs (class centroids) —
# NEVER gene names, NEVER padded surface synonyms.
# name           | trigger verbs (class centroids)   | rules-file                | (concepts)
sensor           | sense detect recognize            | rules/sensor.rules         |
transducer       | relay propagate transduce         | rules/transducer.rules     |
amplifier        | amplify enhance potentiate        | rules/amplifier.rules      |
differentiator   | differentiate stratify conserve   | rules/differentiator.rules |
coexpressor      | track mirror accompany            | rules/coexpressor.rules    |
component        | amplify sense relay track differentiate | rules/component.rules  |
zero             | lack miss omit                    | rules/zero_signal.rules    |
